  questionText: 'What is the correct formula for calculating the

    radius of curvature?'
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: 'I = 3 cm h = 0.060 cm

    R = 3<sup> 2 </sup> /6(0.060)+0.060/2

    R
    = 25+0.03


    R ~ 25 cm



'
  options:
